The supplementary material is organized as follows.
Sec. B provides implementation and training details
for the shared latent interface and cross-model OPD;
Sec. C reviews additional related work;
Sec. D reports extended quantitative results,
including additional benchmarks, efficiency analysis, and rollout
scheduling ablations;
Sec. E presents additional qualitative examples
and handoffs at different denoising steps; and
Sec. 5 discusses the limitations of our method.

